    <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Data-use rules</h2>
    <p>Feeds expose published intelligence only. Draft, review and unpublished records are not intentionally exposed through these feeds.</p>
    <p>Each record retains its source URL and verification/observation date where available. Consumers should check the original source before making financial, commercial, legal or production decisions.</p>
    <p>These are static public feeds, not a paid API and not a replacement for the original government, research, market or development-agency source.</p>
